Question 2: Spring Boot Data JPA – Employee
Attendance System (Timestamping)
Scenario
Develop a Spring Boot application for an Employee Attendance System. Whenever an
employee record is created or modified, the application should automatically maintain the
creation and last updated timestamps.
Requirements
Create an Entity named Employee.
